<title>USA: TABLE - New York Times sets qtly divs.</title>
<headline>TABLE - New York Times sets qtly divs.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-07-17</dateline>
<text>
<p>New York Times Co said it declared a quarterly dividend on its class A common stock.</p>
<p>					Quarterly</p>
<p>		   Latest		    Prior</p>
<p> Amount		  $0.16		     $0.16</p>
<p> Pay		   Sept 19</p>
<p> Record		 Sept 2</p>
<p>----</p>
<p>New York Times Co said it declared a quarterly dividend on its class B common stock.</p>
<p>					Quarterly</p>
<p>		   Latest		    Prior</p>
<p> Amount		  $0.16		     $0.16</p>
<p> Pay		   Sept 19</p>
<p> Record		 Sept 2</p>
